*---------------------------Heating & Current Drive--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------*
*‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾*

i_hcd_calculations = 1
* DESCRIPTION:   Switch for current drive calculation
* JUSTIFICATION: Consistency equation, should always be on.

*~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
* This should apply to all heating systems but need to check

*icc = 40
* DESCRIPTION:   Constraint equation for auxiliary power lower limit
* JUSTIFICATION: Turned off, do not care about auxiliary power lower limit 
* VARIABLES:     p_hcd_injected_total_mw (MW) calculated in-situ

*p_hcd_injected_min_mw =  
* DESCRIPTION:   Minimum required auxiliary power (MW)
* JUSTIFICATION: Turned off, not using icc = 40


*~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
*icc = 37
* DESCRIPTION:   Constraint equation for current drive gamma upper limit
* JUSTIFICATION: Turned off, do not care about maximum current drive gamma
* VARIABLES:     eta_cd_norm_hcd_primary(1.0e20 A/W-m2) calculated in-situ

*eta_cd_norm_hcd_primary_max =  
* DESCRIPTION:   Maximum current drive gamma (icc = 37)
* JUSTIFICATION: Turned off, not using icc = 37 

*~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~ Primary H&CD System ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
*‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾

i_hcd_primary = 13
* DESCRIPTION   Switch for Current Drive Efficiency Model (10: ECRH User Input gamma)
* 1 Fenstermacher Lower Hybrid
* 2 Ion Cyclotron current drive
* 3 Fenstermacher ECH
* 4 Ehst Lower Hybrid
* 5 ITER Neutral Beam
* 6 new Culham Lower Hybrid model
* 7 new Culham ECCD model
* 8 new Culham Neutral Beam model
* 9 RFP option removed in PROCESS (issue #508)
* 10 ECRH user input gamma
* 11 ECRH "HARE" model (E. Poli, Physics of Plasmas 2019)
* 12 EBW scaling (S. Freethy)
* 13 ECRH cut-off (S. Freethy)
* JUSTIFICATION: Design choice

*~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
icc = 30
* DESCRIPTION:   Injection Power Upper Limit
* JUSTIFICATION: Limit for plasma stability
* VARIABLES:     p_hcd_injected_total_mw (total auxiliary injected power (MW)) summed from all injected power sources

p_hcd_injected_max = 225.0
* DESCRIPTION:   Maximum Allowable Value for Injected Power (MW) (icc=30)
* JUSTIFICATION: 

*~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

*ixc = 11
*p_hcd_primary_extra_heat_mw = 
*boundl(11) = 
*boundu(11) = 
* DESCRIPTION:   Heating power not used for C.D. (MW)
* JUSTIFICATION: Not used, ECRH will always drive current 

feffcd = 1.0
* DESCRIPTION:   Current Drive Efficiency Fudge Factor
* JUSTIFICATION: Default, no change

