*i_hcd_secondary = 
* DESCRIPTION:   Switch for 2nd current drive efficiency model
* JUSTIFICATION: Not used, ECRH only

*p_hcd_secondary_injected_mw = 
* DESCRIPTION:   Secondary auxiliary injection power (MW)
* JUSTIFICATION: Not used, ECRH only

