*i_bldgs_size = 
* DESCRIPTION:   Switch between routines estimating building sizes (0 = default)
* JUSTIFICATION: Not yet set

*i_bldgs_v = 
* DESCRIPTION:   Switch to select verbose output for buildings (1 = verbose)
* JUSTIFICATION: Not yet set

